msgstr "Доказательство моих трудов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CLOTHSAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CLOTHSAIL"
