msgstr "Место для всяких штук."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_PALLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_PALLET"
msgid "It could use some work."
