msgstr "У-у-упс."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNT"
