msgstr "Горячо! Слишком горячо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
