msgstr "Этот огонь готов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ROCK_OBSIDIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ROCK_OBSIDIAN"
