msgstr "Эта штука реальна?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ROOTTRUNK_CHILD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ROOTTRUNK_CHILD"
