msgstr "Пахнет, как каюта капитана."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ROUND_DOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ROUND_DOOR"
