#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS1"
