msgstr "Павший враг."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.HOUNDFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.HOUNDFIRE"
