msgstr "Какая большая колонна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECO_CHAIR_BENCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECO_CHAIR_BENCH"
