msgstr "Оно не оплодотворено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED"
