#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.GENERIC"
