msgstr "Mandragora officinarum. Только с лицом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEHOUSE"
