#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.GENERIC"
