#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_TALL_CURTAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_TALL_CURTAIN"
