msgstr "О-о-о-о-о-о-о-о-о-о! ОБОЖАЮ такое!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGOON"
