msgstr "Беги, пока можешь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.GENERIC"
