#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_2"
