msgstr "Падающий камень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNING"
