#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD_FULL"
