msgstr "Не мой размерчик."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_RELIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_RELIC"
