msgstr "Приготовлю ее вкусно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_COOKED"
