msgstr "Самое то для ночного кутежа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH"
