msgstr "Да. Внизу есть смола."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TAR_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TAR_TRAP"
