msgstr "Время делать ноги."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB"
